ied public HTML game after track start and a normal note-key input.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/rhythm-master-windsurf.webp","alt","A purple 3D rhythm highway with four note lanes, score and combo panels, a track timer and keyboard prompts.","https://github.com/frankjniu/rhythm-game","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap local capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86,87],"Windsurf","Claude 模型 / 对话","links","相关资源",[93],"resourceIds","section",{"_61":94,"_25":95},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","创作者开发记录",[99],"evidence",{"_61":100,"_25":101,"_102":103},"查看作者使用的 AI 工具与提示词","https://www.linkedin.com/posts/frankniu_if-youre-not-vibe-coding-with-claude-sonnet-activity-7304977951761039362-2xQe","note","The creator identifies Claude Sonnet 3.7, describes passing output into Windsurf, and links the exact rhythm-game repository in the same post.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[108],{"_61":109,"_25":74,"_102":110},"查看完整音游源码","The full game is rhythm.html, with procedural music and geometry rather than a separate asset download. Third-party libraries load from CDNs. No repository code license is declared.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[116],{"_61":117,"_25":118,"_102":119},"Download and run Rhythm Master 3D","https://github.com/frankjniu/rhythm-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","No public hosted build was verified. Serve the downloaded directory and open rhythm.html. External CDNs supply Three.js and Tone.js, so internet access is needed; a click starts audio.","游戏平台","源码下载","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[127],{"_61":128,"_25":101,"_102":-7},"阅读作者的开发流程","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[133,134,135,136],"Download the repository and serve its directory with a local HTTP server, then open rhythm.html.","Choose a track and difficulty, start the game, and use D/F/J/K as notes reach the target zone.","Test combo scoring, Escape pause and the Space special mode before changing timing or difficulty.","Compare the single-file implementation with the creator’s original brief and debugging workflow.","AI 工作流与开发背景","Frank Niu 在作者帖子中链接这款游戏，并描述 Claude Sonnet 3.7 网页对话与 Windsurf 配合的流程：先生成初版，在对话中诊断问题，再由 Windsurf 应用修改。这是人工引导的开发案例，没有证据表明使用了 Claude Code 或一次自主运行完成。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js · Tone.js · JavaScript","engine","lead","3d",[133,134,135,136],{"_61":166,"_25":101,"_17":167},{"_61":117,"_25":118,"_17":112,"_102":119},{"_61":163,"_25":74,"_102":110,"_164":165},{"_61":162,"_25":101,"_102":103},[161],"ai-assisted","threejs","Read the author’s AI tools and prompt disclosure","Open the complete rhythm-game source","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s build workflow","build-log",{"_169":170},"documents",{"_66":171,"_35":172},[174,178,179,180,177,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,176,213,175,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234],[173,174,175,176,177],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-d